38001>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent Zoom from a Zoom.
38001>>>                Case Break
38002>>>
38002>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38002>>>
38002>>>        Case End
38002>>>
38002>>>        Send SetActionButtons
